@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName sans-serif
skinparam roundCorner 10

title EduCore — Cross-Role Collaborative Workflows

box "University Administration" #F8F9FA
actor "University Admin" as UniAdmin
actor "Department Admin" as DeptAdmin
end box

box "Instruction & Students" #F1F5F9
actor "Lecturer" as Lecturer
actor "Student" as Student
end box

actor "Public Verifier" as Verifier

== Academic Offering & Course Registration ==
UniAdmin -> DeptAdmin : Opens Semester for enrollment
DeptAdmin -> Lecturer : Creates section & assigns Lecturer
DeptAdmin -> DeptAdmin : Schedules room & time slot (0 conflicts)
Student -> Student : Discovers section on /registration
Student -> Student : Registers (passes prerequisites & capacity)

== Instruction, Attendance & Submissions ==
Lecturer -> Student : Takes daily attendance (records Present/Absent)
Lecturer -> Student : Posts course materials & coursework assignments
Student -> Lecturer : Uploads assignment submission before deadline
Lecturer -> Student : Grades submission and enters feedback

== Grading, Approval & GPA ==
Lecturer -> DeptAdmin : Computes weighted grades & submits grade sheet
DeptAdmin -> UniAdmin : Reviews & approves department grades
UniAdmin -> UniAdmin : Finalizes grades (permanently locks sheet)
UniAdmin -> Student : Triggers GPA recalculation & publishes transcript

== Document Request & Public Verification ==
Student -> DeptAdmin : Requests official Study Certificate
DeptAdmin -> Student : Approves request & generates PDF with QR Code
Student -> Verifier : Presents certificate to employer
Verifier -> Verifier : Scans QR code (/verify/{token}) & views verified university badge

@enduml
